      "rationale": "Distinguishes acute/emergency activation from routine follow-up, which is relevant to urgency. Some overlap with chief_complaint_category's chronic_disease_followup value, but emergency_activation adds distinct leverage. Sample values well grounded."
    },
    {
      "name": "diagnostic_urgency_proxy",
