      "source_groundedness": 0.85,
      "hallucination_observed": false,
      "rationale": "Workup intensity (stat imaging, emergent labs, ECG monitoring vs no_workup) is a strong actionable urgency signal derivable from documented orders. Samples align (MRI ordered -> stat_imaging, labs -> routine_labs_imaging). Some ordinal inference but well warranted by text."
